<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nomura starts COMPAQ as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nomura starts COMPAQ as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Nomura said it initiated Compaq Computer Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $4.56 per share for 1996, and $5.62 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $90. Shares rose 1/8 to 75-1/4.</p>
</text>
